## Overview

Every change follows the builder's rule, and each "Two pizza" team owns its service end--to--end.
A hand-off between teams needs a written note --- the on-call log.

## Glossary

:::glossary Terms
- **Builder's rule**: Whoever builds a service runs it.
- **"Two pizza" team**: A team small enough to be fed by two pizzas.
- **end--to--end**: From the first request to the last byte stored.
:::
